  "sample_mapping_evidence": "GSE168453 original covars and pool mapping distinguish donor/timepoint biological specimens from nine multiplex pools and 50 droplet reactions. Initial ingestion selects 156 dated patient specimens from 64 donors with exclude_restricted=no, excluding yes-flagged records and all 11 control donor identities with missing collection time. Original timepoints 0/4/7/14 are nominal collection visits; days_from_start and available actual_timepoint evidence are retained separately. Every donor/timepoint has one source days_from_start value. Control aliquot identity remains pending rather than inventing collection times. Raw.X sampled integer counts across 18,006 genes; full checks remain runtime gates.",
